Explain high-purity chemicals through traceability, purification and contamination control (@ic-high-purity: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @industrial-chemistry, #source "../sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP", #source "../sources/Organic-Fine-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_0DH473049K4WX7HAAY1P7SDS3K", #source "../sources/Ammonia-Isotope-Protocol-Andersen.lingua#r_6HZE6EB62D0Z20SG5XFRNTDVST", #industrial-chemistry "../../../inquiry/metrology/applications/Chemical-and-reference-material-measurements.lingua#r_78FAVM8QZ3F7N4DQP2DDP1R7KQ", #industrial-gases-and-vacuum "../../../utilities/industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/production/Specialty-gases-connect-chemistry-with-clean-delivery.lingua#r_3RBDKJVMK6BED7SA30SAAK62FF") { r_0A8DYYGK7WSS534DBYFKFT5HPT
**Read:** [Production of Speciality Inorganic Chemicals, BREF SIC](../sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP), the entire relevant purification, product-quality and handling treatment; [Manufacture of Organic Fine Chemicals, BREF OFC](../sources/Organic-Fine-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_0DH473049K4WX7HAAY1P7SDS3K), the full pertinent high-purity isolation, solvent and analytical context; [Quantitative isotope controls for ammonia claims — Andersen and colleagues](../sources/Ammonia-Isotope-Protocol-Andersen.lingua#r_6HZE6EB62D0Z20SG5XFRNTDVST), the complete paper, methods/support and correction as a demanding contamination/measurement case.

Purification is a selective redistribution of constituents, not disappearance of impurities by definition. Distillation, adsorption, ion exchange, crystallization, filtration and chemical conversion may remove different species with different recoveries. A process can improve one contaminant while introducing another through reagent, equipment or handling.

Define the actual impurity panel, chemical/particle forms, measurement capability and sampling support. A limit of detection, a reported non-detection and a demonstrated low concentration are distinct claims. The sum of measured impurities may not account for every constituent or material state relevant to use.

Follow the qualified material through contact surfaces, atmosphere, packaging, transfer and storage. Contamination can be spatially or temporally nonuniform; a convenient small sample may miss an influential event or population. A delivered specification must connect with identity and the conditions under which it was established.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete public purification-and-delivery case with its actual primary analytical methods. Independently close target/recovery and consequential impurity inventories, compare two justified trains at the same final requirement and quantify the strongest uncertainty. Design an observation that distinguishes incomplete purification from contamination introduced later or an inadequate measurement model.

